    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "영작문제 1 답안"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "71",
          "text": "What happened to the criminal?"
        },
        {
          "n": "72",
          "text": "Why do they want his family's help?"
        },
        {
          "n": "73",
          "text": "Now here are the rest of today's top stories."
        },
        {
          "n": "74",
          "text": "The volcano created a disaster thousands of miles away, didn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "75",
          "text": "We'll go there sometime next week, won't we?"
        },
        {
          "n": "76",
          "text": "When will(shall) we have a live report?"
        },
        {
          "n": "77",
          "text": "In fact many of them are from Los Angeles, aren't they?"
        },
        {
          "n": "78",
          "text": "It is high noon in Los Angeles, isn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "79",
          "text": "Welcome back to Korea."
        },
        {
          "n": "80",
          "text": "They are probably up."
        },
        {
          "n": "81",
          "text": "You had a toothache yesterday, didn't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "82",
          "text": "Has it stopped aching now?"
        },
        {
          "n": "83",
          "text": "The tooth is aching now."
        },
        {
          "n": "84",
          "text": "What's in them?"
        },
        {
          "n": "85",
          "text": "They are cooperating with the agency."
        },
        {
          "n": "86",
          "text": "The Defense Department wouldn't comment any further than that."
        },
        {
          "n": "87",
          "text": "That could reduce the fear of suspects."
        },
        {
          "n": "88",
          "text": "They have to(must) deal with the disaster."
        },
        {
          "n": "89",
          "text": "Which(what) company makes chewing tobacco?"
        },
        {
          "n": "90",
          "text": "How did the government boost its sale?"
        }
      ]
    },
